  },
  "contract": [
    "R2465 preserves one direct immediate IS_CONTAINED_BY from Step to either Workflow or Step; each selected parent must have applicable Container classification.",
    "R2465 declares the conditional exclusive choice between 1+ nested Steps and exactly one RUNS target chosen from Action or Workflow. Counts apply per Step; no inverse exact-one is inferred.",
    "R2464 retains one or more Step children and its independent IS_RUN_BY and HAS_EXECUTION allowances. R2467 separately allows IS_RUN_BY from Step; R2638 defines RUNS Step→Action/Workflow and its inverse remains R2623.",
    "R1528 retains trace/evidence and exactly one Action Run for Action-running leaves; Workflow-running leaves are not silently assigned an Action Run. R2245/R2751 continue Step Run→Step."
  ],
